{"version":1,"content":"<p>以色列周二（27日）舉行2023年10‧7哈馬斯突襲以來首場國會大選，出口民調顯示，以色列大選陷入僵局，總理內塔尼亞胡與對手艾森科特（Gadi Eisenkot）雙方陣營都未能取得國會120席中過半的61席。</p><p>預測結果顯示，內塔尼亞胡的執政聯盟受挫。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:21:16.812004+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T00:36:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T01:38:19.270008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:18:15.235999+00:00","content_hash":"5905c62f0cf63d2f0b9fc309f7b321f559c1054621e3f38cc59611dc9524d6d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}